  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nAt the start of the Damage Step, if a monster
    you control battles an opponent's face-up monster: You can discard 1 card; the
    opponent's battling monster's ATK and DEF become half its current ATK and DEF
    (even if this card leaves the field).\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card in
    its owner's Monster Zone is destroyed by your opponent's attack or card effect:
    You can add 1 Warrior or Spellcaster-Type monster with 2000 or less ATK from
    your Deck to your hand, except \"Dragodies, the Empowered Warrior\", during the
    End Phase of this turn."
